  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1325\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>《奇幻家具》</strong>是一款模块化模组，为 Minecraft 添加了多种全新的<strong>家具套装</strong>与<strong>装饰性</strong>方块。<br>这些家具方块包括但不限于：<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>、<strong>书架</strong>、<strong>门</strong>、<strong>烤箱</strong>、<strong>沙发</strong>、<strong>架子</strong>、<strong>柜台</strong>以及<strong>门</strong>。</p>\n<h3><strong>合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>每件家具均可在新增的<strong>家具工作台</strong>中，将对应的<strong>羊毛</strong>与<strong>木板</strong>方块同<strong>粘合剂</strong>物品（<strong>黏土球</strong>）一起放入来完成合成。</p>\n<p><strong>家具工作台</strong>可在任意 2x2 合成网格（或更大）中，放入一个<strong>合成台</strong>加上一块<strong>皮革</strong>来制作。</p>\n<h3><strong>模块</strong></h3>\n<p>《奇幻家具》已拆分为多个模块，每个模块对应一套家具。这样玩家可以自由选择想要游玩的家具套装。<br>仅安装《奇幻家具》本体不会获得任何家具内容，请务必安装以下模块之一。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-nordic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>北欧（Nordic）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-venthyr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>温西尔（Venthyr）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-dunmer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>敦默（Dunmer）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-bone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>骨骼（Bone）</strong> - 包含 2 种变体（<strong>骨骼</strong>与<strong>凋零（Wither）</strong>）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-royal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>皇家（Royal）</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-necrolord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>死灵领主（Necrolord）</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>除了上述模块外，我们还提供了<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture-decorations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>装饰（Decorations）</strong>模块</a>。与上面不同，该模块不会添加新的家具套装，而是提供各类额外的装饰方块。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
